---
const currentLocale = Astro.currentLocale || "en";
---

<section class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center">
  <div
    class="text-pretty leading-relaxed text-gray-200 [&>p>strong]:font-semibold [&>p>strong]:text-yellow-300 [&>p]:mb-4"
  >
    {
      currentLocale === "es" ? (
        <>
          <p>
            Soy <strong>Fernando Cantora</strong>. Me desempeño como{" "}
            <strong>Technical Project / Product Manager &amp; Solutions Lead</strong> respaldado por{" "}
            <strong>
              11 años de experiencia relevando requerimientos y gestionando relaciones B2B
            </strong>{" "}
            directamente con dueños de empresas y tomadores de decisiones C-level en{" "}
            <strong>Banco Credicoop</strong>, combinado con experiencia práctica en{" "}
            <strong>ingeniería de software Fullstack</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            Lidero el ciclo de vida completo de productos digitales desde el{" "}
            <strong>discovery hasta el lanzamiento a producción</strong>: entrevistas con
            stakeholders, mapeo de procesos <strong>As-Is / To-Be</strong>, definición de alcance
            del MVP, priorización de roadmap a través de épicas e historias de usuario con criterios
            de aceptación, modelado de datos relacional en SQL/PostgreSQL y{" "}
            <strong>prototipado rápido asistido por IA (Cursor, v0)</strong> para validar en horas
            antes de comprometer esfuerzo de desarrollo.
          </p>
          <p>
            Mi fluidez técnica me permite alinear equipos multifuncionales de ingeniería, estimar
            esfuerzos con precisión y entregar resultados de negocio medibles en entornos
            Agile/Scrum.
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>
            I am <strong>Fernando Cantora</strong>, a{" "}
            <strong>Technical Project / Product Manager &amp; Solutions Lead</strong> backed by{" "}
            <strong>
              11 years of experience eliciting requirements and managing B2B relationships
            </strong>{" "}
            directly with business owners and C-level decision-makers at{" "}
            <strong>Banco Credicoop</strong>, combined with hands-on{" "}
            <strong>Fullstack software engineering</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
            I own the end-to-end product lifecycle from{" "}
            <strong>discovery to production release</strong>: stakeholder interviews,{" "}
            <strong>As-Is / To-Be process mapping</strong>, MVP scoping, roadmap prioritization
            across epics and user stories with acceptance criteria, relational SQL/PostgreSQL data
            modeling, and <strong>rapid AI-assisted prototyping (Cursor, v0)</strong> to validate
            scope within hours before committing engineering effort.
          </p>
          <p>
            My technical fluency allows me to align cross-functional engineering teams, estimate
            effort accurately, and deliver measurable business outcomes within Agile/Scrum
            environments.
          </p>
        </>
      )
    }
  </div>
</section>
